   "Non-export design suits areas without net metering and can simplify permitting where interconnection rules are strict.",
   "Two MPPT channels totalling 10kW of solar input allow flexible string configurations.",
   "Automatic generator start based on battery SOC helps off-grid users manage generator run time.",
