   "Idle consumption of 15W, dropping to 3W in search mode, reduces overnight standby losses on off-grid systems.",
   "You can start with one unit and add a second of the same model later for 120/240V split-phase at 8,000W continuous across both legs.",
   "PowerAssist can add up to 4kW from the battery on top of incoming AC, so a limited circuit can handle temporary spikes."
